			"17": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": false
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1 - TECHNICAL DEMONSTRATION\n\nIn this example we are demonstrating this node purely from a technical point of view.\nThe Trigger In creates a trigger event which activates the two Trigger nodes.\nThese two nodes launch on exactly the same frame.\nLet's assume we don't want this.\nSo, we introduce the Collapse Triggers node, which reduces all the triggers happening on the same frame back to a single trigger.\nWe can test this with the Print node, which only prints a single line to the Log panel.\n"
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 411.525177001953125,
					"width": 995.50592041015625,
					"x": 190.08673095703125,
					"y": 404.3905029296875
				},
				"class": {
					"id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
					"version": 1
				},
				"clock": "video",
				"color": "ffff6a00",
				"constants": {},
				"hidden": [
					"text",
					"alignment",
					"font-size",
					"fill"
				],
				"name": "Group",
				"thumbnail_visible": true
			},
			"21": {
				"attributes": {
					"alignment": {
						"type": "integer",
						"value": 0
					},
					"fill": {
						"type": "bool",
						"value": true
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "COLLAPSE TRIGGERS\n\nThe Collapse Triggers takes all trigger events occuring on the same frame and reduces them down to a single trigger. This can be useful to prevent double triggers on the same frame.\n\nIf you need a way to reduce a collection of triggers down to a single trigger(not taking duplicates into account), you can use the Converge node. If you want to output a collection of triggers channel by channel, use the Circulate node."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 179.023834228515625,
					"width": 653.1705322265625,
					"x": 189.6700439453125,
