					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2 - PRACTICAL APPLICATION\n\nIn this example we have two Metronomes running at 1hz and 4 hz.\nThe triggers are used to Circulate through 10 channels, popping up a rhombus at a time.\nEventually both Metronomes will produce a trigger on the same frame. \nThis would cause the Circulate to advance twice on the same frame, glitching out our visual.\nTo prevent this we use Collapse Triggers."
					}
				},
